  "description": "BAN (Bi-Temporal Adapter Network) is a universal foundation model-based adaptation framework for remote sensing change detection, leveraging frozen foundation models (e.g., CLIP, RemoteCLIP) and bridging modules to inject general knowledge into arbitrary change detection models (Bi-TAB).",
